{"text": "After four weeks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The witch was tired. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of waiting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fat or thin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hansel will be my dinner today. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She heated the big oven. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And told Gretel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To look inside. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But Gretel said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I do not know. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How to do it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Silly goose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Cried the witch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And she put her own head inside. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Quickly Gretel pushed her in and shut the iron door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The witch was never seen again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And Gretel ran. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To free Hansel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the witchs house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They found. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pearls and shining jewels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A white duck carried them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Across a wide lake. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One at a time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When they got home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Their father was happier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than ever before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The woman had died. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And they all lived happily together.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "f", "o", "u", "r", " ", "w", "e", "e", "k", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "c", "h", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "i", "r", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "f", " ", "w", "a", "i", "t", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "a", "t", " ", "o", "r", " ", "t",